        "node_id": "n_5_91c084",
        "thought_text": "Consider using a different approach to detect trends, such as calculating the average rate of change over the observed period. Specifically, compute the difference between each pair of consecutive days and analyze the overall trend based on these differences. If all differences are positive, the moon is increasing; if all are negative, it is decreasing; otherwise, the trend is uncertain.",
